  "final_text": "New chat\nImages\nPlugins\nDeep research\nSee plans and pricing\nHelp\nSettings\nGet responses tailored to you\n\nLog in to get answers based on saved chats, plus create images and upload files.\n\nLog in\nChatGPT\nLog in\nSign up for free\nYou said:\n\nhii\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHii! \ud83d\ude0a How are you doing? What can I help you with today?\n\nYou said:\n\nhello\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHello! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a Nice to see you again. What\u2019s on your mind?\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats your name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI\u2019m ChatGPT, powered by OpenAI. \ud83d\ude0a\nYou can call me GPT if you like!\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats my name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI don\u2019t know your name yet \ud83d\ude04 You haven\u2019t told me.\n\nWhat should I call you? \ud83d\ude0a\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats the wheather today\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nIf you mean Tamil Nadu, today (Oct 6) is looking hot and humid with chances of rain/thunderstorms. \ud83c\udf26\ufe0f\n\n\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Rain: Heavy rain is possible in some districts, especially parts of western Tamil Nadu.\n\n\u26c8\ufe0f Thunderstorms: Possible in several areas.\n\n\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Temperature: Many places are around the mid-30s \u00b0C during the day.\n\n\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f Winds: Gusty winds may accompany thunderstorms. \nN\nnewsonair.gov.in\n+1\n\nIf you tell me your city/town (e.g., Chennai, Madurai, Coimbatore), I can give you today's weather and rain chances for your exact area. \ud83d\ude0a\n\nN\nSources\n\nChatGPT is AI and can make mistakes.\n\nChat with ChatGPT\nResponse stopped",
